== Description ==

The '''Electronics Workbench''' assembles circuits, sensors, generators, and vehicle electronics. It defines 6 raw recipe entries (6 unique after consolidating shape variants), producing outputs including [[Electrical Wire]], [[Simple Generator]], [[Simple Motor]], [[Solar Battery]], [[Sound Sensor]], [[Transformer]].

== Technical ==

Internal enum value: <code>WorkbenchType.ElectronicsWorkbench</code> (assembly <code>UI</code>). Prefab: <code>WB_Electronic</code>.

